      "status": "completed",
      "startedAt": "2026-09-11T02:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-11T02:24:00.000Z",
      "tags": ["Attention", "PyTorch", "因果性"],
      "sessions": [
        {
          "id": "demo-session-attention",
          "source": "codex",
          "startedAt": "2026-09-11T02:00:00.000Z",
          "updatedAt": "2026-09-11T02:24:00.000Z",
          "models": [],
          "messages": [
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m1",
              "role": "user",
              "content": "为什么因果 attention 要在 softmax 之前加 mask？我能不能先得到权重，再把未来位置清零？",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:00:00.000Z",
              "model": null
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m2",
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "先清除分数，未来位置就不会参与归一化的分母。若归一化后只将部分权重清零，剩余权重的总和通常不再是 1。可以先用一个很小的矩阵观察差别。\n\n```python\npositions = torch.arange(seq_len)\nmask = positions[None, :] <= positions[:, None]\nscores = scores.masked_fill(~mask, float(\"-inf\"))\nweights = torch.softmax(scores, dim=-1)\n```",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:04:00.000Z",
              "model": null
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m3",
              "role": "user",
              "content": "我想验证的是“读不到未来”。保持前面位置不变，只改最后一个 token；如果 mask 生效，前面位置的输出应保持不变。",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:10:00.000Z",
              "model": null
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m4",
              "role": "assistant",
              "content": "示例工具调用：运行因果性检查，比较扰动最后一个 token 前后的输出。\n\n```text\npython check_causal_attention.py\n```",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:14:00.000Z",
              "model": null,
              "toolName": "terminal",
              "callId": "demo-attention-check"
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m5",
              "role": "tool",
              "content": "演示输出：前面位置的输出保持一致；最后一个位置的输出发生变化。\n该结果仅用于展示工具记录的界面，不代表真实执行过测试。",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:15:00.000Z",
              "model": null,
              "toolName": "terminal",
              "callId": "demo-attention-check"
            },
            {
              "id": "demo-attention-m6",
              "role": "user",
              "content": "现在能把公式和行为联系起来了：mask 决定哪些位置允许进入归一化，因果性则可以通过改变未来输入来检查。这个检查仍不能代替完整的数值测试。",
              "timestamp": "2026-09-11T02:24:00.000Z",
              "model": null
            }
          ],
          "warnings": ["演示数据，不是从真实 agent 会话导入的记录。"]
        }
      ],
